	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Tuas 12. huius mensis scriptas d. <persName ref="p629">Coignetius</persName> per proprium <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>nuncium huc misit.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Miramur valde landgrafii iudicium; <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>sed hae sunt artes <persName>Guisianorum</persName>, qui <placeName ref="l822">Germanię</placeName> principibus ita <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>oculos perstringunt; spero tamen fore, ut dominus illis eos iterum aperiat.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z5"/>De <persName>Condensi</persName> nihil prorsus audimus, nisi quod in dies amplissimę <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>urbes et respublicae illi accedant; audio enim Remenses et Troianos <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>in <placeName>Campania</placeName> foedus cum illo pepigisse.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">In quam formam foederis <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>coeant, quotquot partium suarum sunt, vidisti nimirum, <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>aut si non vidisti, invenies apud fratrem meum, cui illius foederis <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>formam descriptam mitto.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p629">Coignetius</persName> a prioribus comitiis ex <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>aula aut a rege ne unam quidem literam accepit, quod <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>ita illi mirum est, ut haereat et dubitet, quid cum Helvetiis nunc <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>iterum <placeName ref="l760">Solodori</placeName> collectis agat; putat a <persName>Condensibus</persName> intercipi literas, <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>nec illi hoc dolet, etiamsi miretur.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Heri illuc profecti sunt <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>veteres legati, consul <persName ref="p2305">Negelinus</persName> et <persName ref="p3494">Diesbachius</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Expectamus modo, <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>quid futurum sit.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Pecuniae prius missae alio pertinent nec in hos <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>usus sunt destinatae, unde existimatur fore, ut <placeName ref="l862">Helvetii</placeName>, licet <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>inviti domi maneant.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">De <placeName ref="l301">Lugduno</placeName> nihil audimus; <placeName ref="l1871">Gratiano<lb xml:id="p1z19"/>poli</placeName> tamen et <placeName ref="l1944">Valentiae</placeName> in <placeName ref="l2772">Delphinatu</placeName> omnes ecclesias reformatas <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>esse ferunt et negotium domini foeliciter procedere.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="de">Die handlung <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>mit <placeName ref="l2478">Saffoy</placeName> ist von minen herren den burgeren richtig und glatt abgschlagen; <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>denn diewyl er die capitulation, zuͦ <placeName ref="l28">Basel</placeName> gstellt, nitt wellen <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>annen, mag man wol dencken, das nüt mitt imm zhandlen, und <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>ist man gsinnet, imm glatt nüt umbhin zgan.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Dominus confirmet eos <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>et det successum!</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p8063">Consul Steigerus</persName> in <placeName ref="l2478">Sabaudia</placeName> est, propediem <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>tamen revertetur, tum illi communicabo ea, de quibus scripsisti.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Interea <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>monebo alios quoque, ut sint memores.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="de">Ich sorg, es werd aber <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>ein <placeName>Luggarner</placeName> handel gen; da ist das spil vernetzt, wiewol, <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>so man das recht bruchte, wurde der landßfriden das nitt zuͦgen, <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>dahin si inn spannend.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="de">Die spieß sond je glich lang sin; aber <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>man wil nitt dran.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="de">Gott mache es eins mals beßer.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="de">In <placeName ref="l646">Glaris</placeName>, <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>besorg ich, werd es sich bald heben; da wil ich gern sen, wie man <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>sich gegen inen halten well.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="de">Mich wunderet, ob si botten gen <lb xml:id="p1z34"/><placeName ref="l760">Solloturn</placeName> gschickt, diewyl si vorhin so schmechlich ghalten.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="de">Uß <lb xml:id="p1z35"/><placeName ref="l791">Wallis</placeName> hör ich nüt; die dem evangelio günstig, läbend der <lb xml:id="p1z36"/>mertheil dermaß, das si mee mitt zerstörend dann gwünnend; <lb xml:id="p1z37"/>das macht mir dest minder hoffnung.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z38"/>Ex <placeName ref="l2772">Delphinatu</placeName> hisce diebus <lb xml:id="p1z39"/>adhuc aliquot ecclesiae ministros a nostris petierunt, qui <lb xml:id="p1z40"/>et ipsis concessi sunt.</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la">Dominus faxit, ut ecclesiae ita subinde crescant <lb xml:id="p1z41"/>et augeantur.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la">Alias nunc nihil habeo; quamprimum aliquid <lb xml:id="p1z42"/>cognovero, faciam te certiorem.</s>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Bene vale.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Salutant te amici <lb xml:id="p1z43"/>et fratres omnes, praesertim <persName ref="p8012">Hallerus</persName>, <persName ref="p8389">Hagius</persName>, <persName ref="p8417">Musculus</persName> et <persName ref="p4060">Zehenderi</persName>.</s>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la" ana="salute"><lb xml:id="p1z44"/>Salutem dic uxori, liberis et omni familię tuae, amicis <lb xml:id="p1z45"/>denique et fratribus omnibus meo nomine.</s>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l41">Bernae</placeName> 18. maii 62.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="28" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z46"/>Quid hic vestras attulerit, nondum scio; necdum enim senatus <lb xml:id="p1z47"/>surrexit.</s>
					<s n="29" xml:lang="la">Ipse iussus est expectare; interea has ego scripsi.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="30" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p8018">I[oannes] <lb xml:id="p1z48"/>Hall[erus</persName>], tuus perpetuo.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="31" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Clarissimo viro d. <persName ref="p495">Heinrycho <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>Bullingero</persName>, <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinae</placeName> ecclesię <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>pastori fidelissimo, domino suo <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>colendissimo et compatri charis<lb xml:id="p2z5"/>simo.</s>
					<s n="32" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p2z6"/><placeName ref="l587">Zürich</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
